{"reviews":[{"id":"B015GJJXZC-0","r":5.0,"t":"Great collection and convenience","x":"Great collection and nice, convenient way to try a bunch of colognes.  Yes, these are the same vials you can sometimes get for free at the store, but not this many at once or as easily. The convenience factor alone is worth it.  Like others, I also got a couple of bonus vials, which was very much appreciated and a nice part of the service.  Would recommend.","h":23,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2018"},{"id":"B015GJJXZC-1","r":1.0,"t":"Tiny, tiny, sample sizes.","x":"Massive waste of money.  I blame myself for not processing how much liquid would be in the tiny bottles.  They are literally sample sizes and I could have gone to the department store for free.","h":23,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2018"},{"id":"B015GJJXZC-2","r":1.0,"t":"No.  Just no.","x":"I expected larger samples for the price I paid.  You can get these free from Macy's.","h":17,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2018"},{"id":"B015GJJXZC-3","r":1.0,"t":"Free store samples","x":"Very small sample size bottles. Save your money.","h":17,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2018"},{"id":"B015GJJXZC-4","r":5.0,"t":"Well worth it! More bang for your buck!","x":"This is great for anyone who is a cologne conaseur like me. It gives you a chance to try out multiple colognes for a great price! I have already ordered a couple of big bottles. They also threw in a couple of freebies You also get quite a few uses out of each bottle. You only need a couple sprays, it gose a long way.","h":10,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2017"},{"id":"B015GJJXZC-5","r":4.0,"t":"Nice, but overpriced","x":"They arrived just as shown in the picture.  What you can't really see is that those &#34;boxes&#34; are actually cards folded over with the sample vial held inside with a little sleeve fashioned in the inside fold of the card.  Well, they looked like boxes to me in the photo anyway.  So that disappoints me a little, and I feel like I was swindled a little bit.  I don't know what these little vial samples actually cost, but I know we've gotten them from free at the mall dept stores before.  Do th","h":8,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2016"},{"id":"B015GJJXZC-6","r":5.0,"t":"Mens Cologne Variety","x":"I got this as a Father's Day Gift because I thought my dad would like the variety of colognes.  And, it gives him the opportunity to try different colognes that I can by him for his birthday.","h":8,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2016"},{"id":"B015GJJXZC-7","r":5.0,"t":"Great way to sample cologne!","x":"Wonderful Valentine\u2019s present for my husband! We never go to the mall and this was the perfect way for him to sample fragrances so he can choose one he wants to purchase full-size. So far there aren\u2019t any that he dislikes","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2019"},{"id":"B015GJJXZC-8","r":5.0,"t":"THESE SAMPLES  WERE THE BEST!","x":"This was a great product!!!!  i was  in the market  for a new cologne. I don't like really trying on various  colognes  at the same time.  this  was perfect for me.  Great samples!!  authentic  products!  NO KNOCKOFFS!!,  i get to try each one, wear a day or 2, i found  the one's i want to purchase!.  i have  already  bought  2, full size bottles already!.  I felt like  a genius for taking this route!.  Its just  a simple  and great way to figure out  what you want  if  your  undecided.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2016"},{"id":"B015GJJXZC-9","r":1.0,"t":"One Star","x":"The image deceives. I could have gotten all those samples for free had I wanted them.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2017"},{"id":"B015GJJXZC-10","r":5.0,"t":"Exactly As Advertised","x":"Not sure why there are negative reviews on this. I got exactly what I thought I was purchasing. These are samples that you can try so you can find the cologne that you like best.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2020"},{"id":"B015GJJXZC-11","r":5.0,"t":"A very good sample of fragrances","x":"I love this. Gave me the opportunity to sample several fragrances and find one I like. Very highly recommended.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2017"},{"id":"B015GJJXZC-12","r":5.0,"t":"Good deal, I'm my opinion.","x":"Came as shown. In those little cards are the sample vials. They're good for 2 to 3 different applications depending on how generous you are with cologne. I sprayed a moderate amount and I used it for 2 days. It comes with a bonus cologne which is awesome. I don't see why anyone would give it a negative review. Surely you're not expecting to get full size bottles of Calvin Klein and other high end colognes for that price. You'd have to be stupid to think that. Very good smelling colognes, it's fo","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2017"},{"id":"B015GJJXZC-13","r":3.0,"t":"My fiancee loved sampling the different fragrances","x":"My fiancee loved sampling the different fragrances. But...they're like the little free samples you get at the mall. There are a lot of them but don't expect little bottles. They did give a few extra samples....so that was a plus.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2018"},{"id":"B015GJJXZC-14","r":4.0,"t":"Fine purchase.","x":"Great purchase as gifts for my sons. Gives them an opportunity to try new fragrances before buying the large bottle and they are great for travel.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2017"},{"id":"B015GJJXZC-15","r":5.0,"t":"Great deal!","x":"Got a chance to try multiple ones at a good price without purchasing the regular size.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2016"},{"id":"B015GJJXZC-16","r":1.0,"t":"One Star","x":"OVER PRICED AND THESE ARE SAMPLES NOT PRODUCTS.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2017"},{"id":"B015GJJXZC-17","r":5.0,"t":"Great selection and extra 'bonus' samples were included!","x":"Great selection and extra 'bonus' samples were included! These are the real deal.  Great for travel and intended use (try new colognes to find a new favorite to purchase)","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2017"},{"id":"B015GJJXZC-18","r":1.0,"t":"Not a value","x":"I thought these might be small bottles, but they really are samples you could get from the counter of a department store. Not a good price for what you get, in my opinion","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2020"},{"id":"B015GJJXZC-19","r":5.0,"t":"Nice selection","x":"Having a bunch of minis is convenient when your not sure on what cologne you want to invest in I like the company too, they're quick to respond with any questions","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2019"},{"id":"B015GJJXZC-20","r":1.0,"t":"The size were fully misrepresented","x":"What a dirty jip  these are samples given out and I paid. Pictures  do not show how small really are again these ate samples like you get at Macy's","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2019"},{"id":"B015GJJXZC-21","r":1.0,"t":"Two of the bottles the caps wouldn't even open up ...","x":"Two of the bottles the caps wouldn't even open up to let the product out. Stick with the samples from the store","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2018"},{"id":"B015GJJXZC-22","r":3.0,"t":"Three Stars","x":"I was thinking these were travel size and not just samples obviously taken from a store","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2016"},{"id":"B015GJJXZC-23","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"Great way to try out different scents before you buy a big bottle!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2016"},{"id":"B015GJJXZC-24","r":1.0,"t":"Make sure when you receive them, they are unopened..","x":"7 of them were used or defective. Less than half full.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2018"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers appreciate the convenience of sampling many fragrances at once to find one they want to buy full-size.","cites":[1,5,7,8,9,11,12,15]},{"text":"Several reviewers complain the samples are tiny and comparable to free store samples, calling it overpriced or a waste of money.","cites":[2,3,4,6,10,14]},{"text":"Multiple reviewers mention receiving bonus or extra sample vials as a plus.","cites":[1,5,13,14]},{"text":"Some reviewers note the samples come in folded cards rather than boxes, which differed from the product photo.","cites":[6,13]},{"text":"Reviewers report each sample provides a few uses, enough to wear for a day or two.","cites":[5,9,13]}]},"qa":[]}